[style name="intro_fs"]
[speed=4] Dear Diary,\
\
The water carries mama's hydrangeas into the house.\
\
I make a soggy bouquet trying to save them\
\
As Mama packs our bags\
\
And Daddy plants his feet\
\
"I can't let it go," he says, "This is our home."
